{"id":45510,"date":"2025-10-05T07:54:12","date_gmt":"2025-10-05T06:54:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-boston-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:42:42","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:42:42","slug":"maratona-de-boston","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-boston\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Boston 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Boston 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Boston 2027<\/strong> (131st Boston Marathon presented by Bank of America) \u00e9 a maratona anual mais antiga e venerada do mundo, integrando a prestigiada s\u00e9rie <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong> no estado do Massachusetts, <strong>Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Disputada tradicionalmente na terceira segunda-feira de abril (Patriots&#8217; Day), representa o auge da consagra\u00e7\u00e3o para qualquer maratonista mundial.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com o seu m\u00edtico percurso ponto a ponto de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> com partida na vila rural de <strong>Hopkinton<\/strong> e chegada apote\u00f3tica na <strong>Boylston Street \/ Copley Square<\/strong> no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Boston, os atletas enfrentam desafios lend\u00e1rios como o t\u00fanel sonoro de Wellesley College e a temida subida de <strong>Heartbreak Hill<\/strong> em Newton. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o secular da <strong>Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.)<\/strong> garante a famosa medalha com o unic\u00f3rnio dourado e o casaco oficial comemorativo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Hopkinton (Partida) \/ Boylston Street (Meta), Boston, EUA, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42.195 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.) \/ AbbottWMM<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Boston Marathon (131st Edition)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">BQ \/ Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Qualificada:<\/strong> 250.00 $ USD<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Fase de Registo B.A.A.)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Boston 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova decorre na segunda-feira (Patriots&#8217; Day), 19 de abril de 2027, com partidas por vagas a partir das 09:00 na Main Street em Hopkinton e chegada na Boylston Street (Boston, EUA).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o apuramento por tempos (Boston Qualifier &#8211; BQ)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A grande maioria das vagas \u00e9 atribu\u00edda a atletas que tenham alcan\u00e7ado os exigentes tempos m\u00ednimos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (BQ) por g\u00e9nero e faixa et\u00e1ria em maratonas homologadas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as principais dificuldades do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 ponto a ponto com descida acentuada inicial que castiga os quadric\u00edpites, seguida pelas quatro subidas de Newton entre os km 26 e 34, culminando na famosa Heartbreak Hill.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da B.A.A.?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico, transporte oficial em autocarro de Boston para a Athlete&#8217;s Village em Hopkinton, abastecimentos ao longo de todo o percurso e a lend\u00e1ria medalha do unic\u00f3rnio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o e regulamentos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es e normas oficiais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal baa.org, com acompanhamento de crit\u00e9rios e not\u00edcias no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Boston 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Hopkinton (Partida) \/ Boylston Street (Meta), Boston, EUA\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Boston\", \"addressRegion\": \"Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressCountry\": \"US\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.) \/ AbbottWMM\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Boston 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova decorre na segunda-feira (Patriots' Day), 19 de abril de 2027, com partidas por vagas a partir das 09:00 na Main Street em Hopkinton e chegada na Boylston Street (Boston, EUA).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o apuramento por tempos (Boston Qualifier - BQ)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A grande maioria das vagas \u00e9 atribu\u00edda a atletas que tenham alcan\u00e7ado os exigentes tempos m\u00ednimos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (BQ) por g\u00e9nero e faixa et\u00e1ria em maratonas homologadas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as principais dificuldades do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 ponto a ponto com descida acentuada inicial que castiga os quadric\u00edpites, seguida pelas quatro subidas de Newton entre os km 26 e 34, culminando na famosa Heartbreak Hill.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da B.A.A.?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico, transporte oficial em autocarro de Boston para a Athlete's Village em Hopkinton, abastecimentos ao longo de todo o percurso e a lend\u00e1ria medalha do unic\u00f3rnio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar os tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o e regulamentos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es e normas oficiais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal baa.org, com acompanhamento de crit\u00e9rios e not\u00edcias no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66366,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[1069,1070],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096],"class_list":["post-45510","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-boston-estados-unidos-da-america","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-usa","event_type_5-majors"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-boston-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=45510"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":66093,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510\/revisions\/66093"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/66366"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=45510"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=45510"